---
import ComplianceShell from "../components/ComplianceShell.astro";
---

<ComplianceShell
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of Service for Agentura, including Agentura Test SMS Alerts."
>
  <p slot="intro" class="compliance-lead">
    These Terms of Service describe the terms that apply when you use the Agentura
    website, contact us, or opt in to Agentura Test SMS Alerts.
  </p>

  <section class="compliance-section">
    <h2>Use of the Website</h2>
    <p>
      You may use the Agentura website for lawful informational and communication
      purposes. You agree not to interfere with the website, attempt unauthorized access,
      or use the website in a way that violates applicable law.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="compliance-section">
    <h2>Information and Services</h2>
    <p>
      Website content is provided for general information about Agentura and our services.
      It does not create a client relationship, professional services agreement, or
      guarantee of any particular outcome unless we enter into a separate written
      agreement.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="compliance-section">
    <h2>Agentura Test SMS Alerts Terms</h2>
    <p>
      By opting in to Agentura Test SMS Alerts, you agree to receive recurring
      informational SMS messages from Agentura related to prototype test account notices,
      scheduled maintenance reminders, and security/login alerts.
    </p>
    <p>
      You may opt in on the Agentura SMS Opt-In page or by texting SUBSCRIBE to Agentura
      at (240) 221-6244.
    </p>
    <p>
      Message frequency varies, up to 10 messages/month. Message and data rates may
      apply. <strong>Reply STOP to cancel.</strong> <strong>Reply HELP for help.</strong>
      Consent is not a condition of purchase.
    </p>
    <p>
      SMS consent is not required to create or use an Agentura account, access services,
      log in, complete a transaction, or participate in prototype testing.
    </p>
    <p>
      For help with Agentura Test SMS Alerts, contact
      <a href="mailto:hello@agentura.dev">hello@agentura.dev</a>. Review the Agentura
      Privacy Policy at <a href="/privacy">https://agentura.pages.dev/privacy</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.
    </p>
    <p>
      You may opt out at any time by replying STOP to any Agentura SMS message. After
      opting out, you may receive a confirmation message that you have been unsubscribed.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="compliance-section">
    <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      The website, branding, text, graphics, and other materials are owned by Agentura or
      used with permission. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or create derivative
      works from those materials except as allowed by law or with our written permission.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="compliance-section">
    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      The website or communications may reference third-party services or links. Agentura
      is not responsible for third-party websites, services, policies, or practices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="compliance-section">
    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, Agentura is not liable for indirect,
      incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages arising from use of the
      website or informational communications.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="compliance-section">
    <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>
      Agentura may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the website or
      services after changes are posted means you accept the updated terms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="compliance-section">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about these terms, contact Agentura at
      <a href="mailto:hello@agentura.dev">hello@agentura.dev</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</ComplianceShell>
